   "text": "Reasons from a model are explanations, not proof. They are shown and kept, but\nguards and people decide.",
   "fontSize": 9,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reasons from a model are explanations, not proof. They are shown and kept, but\nguards and people decide.",
