   "text": "A later AI run is a sibling, never a\nreplacement. A person decides whether to\nadopt anything from it.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A later AI run is a sibling, never a\nreplacement. A person decides whether to\nadopt anything from it.",
